<title>USA: Saf-T-Lok new CEO resigns after 2 days.</title>
<headline>Saf-T-Lok new CEO resigns after 2 days.</headline>
<dateline>TEQUESTA, Fla. 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saf-T-Lok Inc said on Thursday that Lisa Broderick resigned as president and chief executive officer after two days, citing differences with the company.</p>
<p>The company said Broderick will return to her duties as a managing director of American Capital Partners Ltd, a merchant banking firm.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk  212-859-1610</p>
</text>
